Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 08:28:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix: launcher drag, keyboard layout, fullscreen and
 navigation defects

- Canvas kept dragging a control after the canvas lost focus or the button
  release was delivered elsewhere; any later mouse move relocated the control.
- Live test and binding capture compared the typed character, so bindings
  did nothing with a non-Latin layout (Russian). Resolve the key from the
  typed Latin character, then Qt's key code, then the physical position.
- Leaving fullscreen always restored a normal window, even when the window
  was maximized before.
- Refusing to discard unsaved controls left the clicked navigation button
  highlighted although the page did not change.
- One unwrapped label was wider than the editor side panel and forced a
  horizontal scroll bar.

Adds 20 Qt regression tests.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
